// Stackra file contract:
// Purpose: the tsconfig a runtime TypeScript loader (tsx in a package's `bin/*.mjs`) applies when it
//          executes workspace sources directly. tsx uses ONE tsconfig and applies it only to the files
//          its `include` matches; the library role includes the package's own `src`, so sources of
//          other workspace packages (legacy parameter decorators) would be transformed without
//          `experimentalDecorators` and fail. This preset widens the match to every package.
// Boundary: referenced from `packages/<category>/<name>/bin/tsconfig.runtime.json` (that depth is
//           what the include below assumes); never by tsc, the build or the tests.
// Runtime: node
// Governing contract: Stackra ADR 0005 (legacy decorators, no metadata)
{
  "display": "@stackra/typescript-config — runtime loader (tsx)",
  "extends": "./library.json",
  "include": [
    "${configDir}/../../../../packages/**/*.ts",
    "${configDir}/../../../../packages/**/*.tsx"
  ]
}
